				{
					"id": 80060505,
					"content": "欸，你这么一说，我也觉得有些眼熟…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80060506,
					"content": "是坎瑞亚的国花——「因提瓦特」。曾盛放在坎瑞亚大地的每一个角落。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80060507,
					"content": "这种花的花期原本只有两周。可若被人折下、带离坎瑞亚的土地，花瓣便不再生长，而且变得十分坚硬。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80060508,
					"content": "直至回到故土之中，花瓣才会重新变得柔软，最终泯于尘土…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80060509,
					"content": "所以，因提瓦特也象征「游子」，寓意着「故乡的温柔」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060510
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80060510,
					"content": "#{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_Twins2Male|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_Twins2Female]}",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060511
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80060511,
					"content": "啊！那这种花出现在这里，也就是说…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060512
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80060512,
					"content": "#{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_GIRLD|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_BOYD]}殿下，您终于同意了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060513
					],
					"speakerTitle": "深渊使徒"
				},
				{
					"id": 80060513,
					"content": "过分专注地投入对抗「天理」之大业，反而淡忘了「复国」的使命。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_MATE_AVATAR",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060514
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80060514,
					"content": "的确，我不该如此优柔寡断。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_MATE_AVATAR",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060515
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80060515,
					"content": "「装置」即将完备，等待殿下您的吩咐。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060516
					],
					"speakerTitle": "深渊使徒"
				},
				{
					"id": 80060516,
					"content": "有多少把握？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_MATE_AVATAR",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060517
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80060517,
					"content": "理论上的可行性，大概…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060518
					],
					"speakerTitle": "深渊使徒"
				},
				{
					"id": 80060518,
					"content": "算了，哪怕只有百分之一的希望…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_MATE_AVATAR",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060519
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80060519,
					"content": "我们不也是一样么，早已身处深渊了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_MATE_AVATAR",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060520
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80060520,
					"content": "对「他们」而言，与其活得毫无尊严，还不如早日回到「循环」之中。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_MATE_AVATAR",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060521
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80060521,
					"content": "不要让「他们」继续背负…那些莫须有的罪孽了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_MATE_AVATAR",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060522
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80060522,
					"content": "您的决断，是教团的幸运。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060523
					],
					"speakerTitle": "深渊使徒"
				},
				{
					"id": 80060523,
					"content": "#{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_YING|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_BROTHER]}…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060524
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80060524,
					"content": "你似乎看到了什么。能说给我听听么？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060525
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80060525,
					"content": "是呀，你好像愣神了好久。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060526
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80060526,
					"content": "将刚刚看到的画面告诉了戴因斯雷布…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060527
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80060527,
					"content": "这是仅属于「双子」的奇妙连接么…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060528
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80060528,
					"content": "听起来，他们试图利用某些装置净化诅咒，可能就是之前我们看到过的那件物品。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060529
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80060529,
					"content": "#而且…{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_SHE|INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_HE]}还提到了「复国」，对么？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060530,
						80060531
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80060530,
					"content": "没错。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060532
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80060532,
					"content": "这个顽固的家伙，果然还没有放弃。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060533
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80060533,
					"content": "看来，教团计划借这一地点净化丘丘人身上的诅咒，想令他们复原…从而作为坎瑞亚复国的根基。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060534
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80060534,
					"content": "毕竟，没有「国民」，便谈不上「国家」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060535,
						80060536
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80060535,
					"content": "你怎么看？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060537
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80060537,
					"content": "哼，愚昧至极。连百分之一的可能性都没有。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060538
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80060538,
					"content": "我应该说过，作为与诅咒共处了五百年的人，没有人比我更明白…绝不存在什么救赎。诅咒是不可逆的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060539
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80060539,
					"content": "强行祛除诅咒的话，除了痛苦，什么都不会得到。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060540
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80060540,
					"content": "所以，要保持清醒，要反复告诫自己——那些已经不是人类了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060541
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80060541,
					"content": "执着于此，投入过多感情，只会越陷越深…最终像它们一样，陷入名为伪善的污泥之中。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060542
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80060542,
					"content": "还是把心思放在更值得拯救的东西上吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060543
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80060543,
					"content": "我凭什么相信你？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060544
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80060544,
					"content": "嗯？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060545
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80060545,
					"content": "#哈哈…也对。我们之间不过是雇佣关系，而{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_SHE|INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_HE]}是你的血亲。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060546
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80060546,
					"content": "#你选择站在{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_SHE|INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_HE]}身边，于情于理，确实没有问题。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060547
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80060547,
					"content": "不论你做出何种选择，都不会撼动我的本心。阻止深渊是我所认定的路，如果无法达成共识，那不妨就此…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060548
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80060548,
					"content": "我这次选择相信你。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060549,
						80060550
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80060549,
					"content": "但不代表我完全信任你。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060551
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80060551,
					"content": "这样吗。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060552,
						80060553
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80060552,
					"content": "百分之一的机会得到救赎。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060554,
						80060555
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80060554,
					"content": "没有任何人有资格…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060556,
						80060557
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80060556,
					"content": "更何况那些丘丘人…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060558
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80060558,
					"content": "看来，我当初问你的三个问题不是没有意义的。你已经找到独属于你的，看待这个世界的方法了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060559
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80060559,
					"content": "既然你吐露了真实想法，我也不打算继续隐瞒。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060560
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80060560,
					"content": "目前，比起单纯地阻止深渊，我更加在乎的是——",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060561
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80060561,
					"content": "绝不能允许深渊以如此独断的行为，来践踏哈夫丹他们的「遗愿」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060562,
						80060563
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80060562,
					"content": "我能理解。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060564
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80060564,
					"content": "深渊随时可能出现，保持警惕，继续前进。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80060563,
					"content": "继续联手吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060564
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80060557,
					"content": "原本已经选择好了自己的归宿。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060558
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80060555,
					"content": "代替其他生命做出这样的选择。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060556,
						80060557
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80060553,
					"content": "百分之九十九的可能痛苦死去。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060554,
						80060555
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80060550,
					"content": "#只是因为我不认同{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_YING|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_BROTHER]}的做法。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060551
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80060536,
					"content": "有机会实现么？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060537
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80060531,
					"content": "#{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_SHE|INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_HE]}说这是使命。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060532
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80060504,
					"content": "我见过这种花。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80060505
					]
				}
			]
		}
	]
}